EqGPT code for PDE discovery from mathematical handbooks.

surrogate_model.py: train the equation model and fit a surrogate field.
continue_train_GPT.py: generate and score equations, then fine-tune on high-scoring candidates.
PINN_optimization.py: refine coefficients of the selected equation.

Paper: https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-025-65114-2
License: Apache-2.0.
